    "imprint_publisher": "Zenodo",
    "notes": "This paper does not claim a derivation of standard gravity or a native inverse-square law. Its scope is the AB two-body closed phase system: acceleration-like harmonic readout is constructible, while distance-exponent readout remains indeterminate without an independent gauge.",
